# A dead bot's trail sinks into the floor (game/rider.h). Straight after boot, in the debug camera:
# Z (a crash only stops the player, who'll reach the small arena's edge), then X x7 shrinks the
# arena to 2000 across. The bot, still 2000 out to the side, is left outside it: pulled to the
# edge when play resumes, a crash, and it dies. (It used to be shrunk later, but the bot now
# boosts clear before then.) Iso, 0.25 s apart: its trail, in the far corner (top right), sinks
# over 1 s and is gone by sink_4.
wait 21
press start
press z
press x 7
press start
press down
shot sink_1
wait 0.25
shot sink_2
wait 0.25
shot sink_3
wait 0.25
shot sink_4
wait 0.25
shot sink_5
wait 0.25
shot sink_6
